  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://v.blakesmods.com/banners/mysticalagradditions?source=curseforge\" width=\"840\" height=\"168\"></span></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mystical-agriculture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://blakesmods.com/img/banner/mysticalagriculture_required.png\" width=\"840\" height=\"92\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mystical-automation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://blakesmods.com/img/banner/mysticalautomation_ad.png\" width=\"840\" height=\"84\"></a></p><p style=\"display:flex\"><a style=\"margin-right:8px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblakesmods.com%252fmystical-agradditions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://api.blakesmods.com/v2/badges/mysticalagradditions/downloads&amp;style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a style=\"margin-right:8px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblakesmods.com%252fmystical-agradditions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://api.blakesmods.com/v2/badges/mysticalagradditions/version&amp;style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a style=\"margin-right:8px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblakesmods.com%252fmystical-agradditions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://api.blakesmods.com/v2/badges/mysticalagradditions/mc_version&amp;style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblakesmods.com%252fwiki%252fmysticalagradditions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=wiki&amp;message=view&amp;color=brightgreen&amp;style=for-the-badge\"> </a></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">此模組為 <a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/mystical-agriculture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mystical Agriculture</a> 增添了更多內容。</span></p><h2><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>特色功能</strong></span></h2><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">第六階精髓：Insanium！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">第六階作物可用於種植高階材料，包括地獄之星、覺醒龍之核心、中子素等！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">多功能鎬斧鏟（Paxel），結合鎬子、斧頭和鏟子的功能於一件工具。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">與 Tinkers' Construct 整合！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">精髓煤炭，比普通煤炭能熔煉更多物品。</span></li>\n</ul><h2><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>資源作物</strong></span></h2><p><strong><em>最後更新於 7.0.2 版本</em></strong></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><strong>原版資源：</strong>地獄之星、龍蛋</em></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><strong>Botania：</strong>蓋亞之魂</em></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><strong>Draconic Evolution：</strong>覺醒龍之核心</em></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><em>Avaritia：</em></strong><em>中子素</em></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><em>Powah：</em></strong><em>硝基水晶</em></span></li>\n</ul>",
